A battery of electromotive force (e.m.f.) $E$ and internal resistance $1.5\Omega$ is connected to a network of resistors, as shown in Fig. 6.1.

{{figure:figure_6_1}}

Resistor X has a resistance of $8.0\Omega$. Resistor Y has a resistance of $2.0\Omega$. Resistor Z has a resistance of $R_Z$. The current in X is $0.60\text{ A}$ and the current in Y is $1.8\text{ A}$.

